## 5. Data assets and where they live

### GitHub (committed, ≤50 MB)
- `data/positions/` — task sets, MATE eval sets, phase pools, benchmark
  holdout, `mate-lora/eval.jsonl` (2.7 MB).
- `data/positions/mate-lora/train.jsonl` — **NOT committed** (>100 MB), see below.

### Hugging Face — `vedangfake/chess-slm-large-assets` (dataset repo, public)
Files that cannot live on GitHub (mirror of repo-relative paths + README
citing sources and regeneration steps + `checksums/*.sha256`):

| path_in_repo | size | what it is |
|---|---|---|
| `data/positions/mate-lora/train.jsonl` | 103 MB | 200k-row LoRA training set (regenerate: `scripts/build_mate_lora_data.py`) |
| `data/positions/mate-lora/eval.jsonl` | 2.7 MB | eval split (also in GitHub) |
| `data/raw/mate-train/strategy.zip` | 70 MB | unmodified MATE train zips (source: `OutFlankShu/MATE_DATASET`) |
| `data/raw/mate-train/no_explain.zip` | 52 MB | unmodified MATE train zips (source: `OutFlankShu/MATE_DATASET`) |
| `results/clean-1000/deepseek-v4-flash_mate-selection-test_strategy.samples.jsonl` | 60 MB | raw teacher samples, strategy subset (harness: `scripts/run_mate_eval.py`) |

**Sources / citations** (also in the HF README):
- MATE dataset — Wang, X., Zhang, M., Wang, C. "MATE: A Large-Scale,
  Multilingual Dataset for LLM-Based Chess Reasoning." NAACL 2025,
  arXiv:2411.06655; `OutFlankShu/MATE_DATASET` on HF.
- Teacher traces — deepseek-v4-flash via the opencode-go gateway; provenance
  (run ids, prompts, verdicts) embedded per line in the samples file.

### Gitignored local-only (re-downloadable / regenerable)
- `data/raw/` (MATE zips — now also on HF), `data/models/`, `results/`,
  `monitor/`, `.rstack/` (research plumbing: `lit-review.jsonl` etc.),
  `.env` (secrets: GITHUB_TOKEN, HF_WRITE_TOKEN, OPENCODE_API_KEY*).

