## 8. Getting started

```bash
python3 -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
python scripts/test_engine.py --quick   # the gate
# deepseek smoke (needs OPENCODE_API_KEY in .env):
python scripts/run_chess.py --model deepseek-v4-flash --task mate1-lichess \
    --prompt-variant fen --n 1 --max_new_tokens 2048 --conditions win \
    --output_dir /tmp/ds_smoke
```
Kaggle secrets needed for campaigns: `GITHUB_TOKEN`, `HF_TOKEN`,
`OPENCODE_API_KEY` (see README §"On Kaggle"). Full detail: `README.md`,
`docs/objective.md`, `docs/memory-decisions.md`.
